# CONTENT [CONTENT]
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# 3-Block Data Structure: The Code Section (Cc + Co + Cv)
#
# Structure: Configuration (Cc) → Operations (Co) → Verification (Cv)
